\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {3}{\ignorespaces Three-dimensional radial spoke sculptures from the origin $O=(0,0,0)$ of variable length and tip weight. (a)~The $16$-spoke radial sculpture $\mathbf  p_{ij}$ ($\beta =1$, spoke length $L_{ij}=R_{ij}$, orange for $z_{ij}>0$, blue for $z_{ij}<0$) of non-associative square \#70 over the floor grid, balancing identically at the central hub $O$ ($\DOTSB \sum@ \slimits@ \mathbf  p_{ij}=\mathbf  0$). (b)~Trimming all $16$ spokes to unit length $L_{ij}=1$ ($\beta =0$, equal tip weights $w_{ij}=1$) on the unit sphere $S^2$ leaves a non-zero resultant $\mathbf  V_0=(0,0.773,0)$ (magenta arrow) on square \#70, whereas antipodal pairs cancel on associative D\"urer \#175. (c)~Assigning the minimum-variance positive tip weights $w_{ij}^*\in [0.72,1.19]$ (sphere tip sizes, gold-rimmed for $w_{ij}^*>1$) restores exact unit-sphere balance $\DOTSB \sum@ \slimits@ w_{ij}^*\hat  {\mathbf  p}_{ij}=\mathbf  0$ at $O$. (d)~Normalized 3D power-law resultant $\|\mathbf  V_\beta (S;1)\|_2/\bar  R^{\beta -1}$ versus length exponent $\beta $, showing universal balance at $\beta =1$, second power-law roots $\beta ^*\ne  1$ on Group~VI squares (\#70 at $\beta ^*=2.24$, \#45 at $0.96$, \#376 at $-0.008$), and identical vertical vanishing $(\mathbf  V_3)_z=0$ at $\beta =3$ (gold dashed curve showing $5|(\mathbf  V_\beta )_z|/\bar  R^{\beta -1}$ on square \#63).}}{8}{figure.26}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:origin-vectors-3d}{{3}{8}{Three-dimensional radial spoke sculptures from the origin $O=(0,0,0)$ of variable length and tip weight. (a)~The $16$-spoke radial sculpture $\mathbf p_{ij}$ ($\beta =1$, spoke length $L_{ij}=R_{ij}$, orange for $z_{ij}>0$, blue for $z_{ij}<0$) of non-associative square \#70 over the floor grid, balancing identically at the central hub $O$ ($\sum \mathbf p_{ij}=\mathbf 0$). (b)~Trimming all $16$ spokes to unit length $L_{ij}=1$ ($\beta =0$, equal tip weights $w_{ij}=1$) on the unit sphere $S^2$ leaves a non-zero resultant $\mathbf V_0=(0,0.773,0)$ (magenta arrow) on square \#70, whereas antipodal pairs cancel on associative D\"urer \#175. (c)~Assigning the minimum-variance positive tip weights $w_{ij}^*\in [0.72,1.19]$ (sphere tip sizes, gold-rimmed for $w_{ij}^*>1$) restores exact unit-sphere balance $\sum w_{ij}^*\hat {\mathbf p}_{ij}=\mathbf 0$ at $O$. (d)~Normalized 3D power-law resultant $\|\mathbf V_\beta (S;1)\|_2/\bar R^{\beta -1}$ versus length exponent $\beta $, showing universal balance at $\beta =1$, second power-law roots $\beta ^*\ne 1$ on Group~VI squares (\#70 at $\beta ^*=2.24$, \#45 at $0.96$, \#376 at $-0.008$), and identical vertical vanishing $(\mathbf V_3)_z=0$ at $\beta =3$ (gold dashed curve showing $5|(\mathbf V_\beta )_z|/\bar R^{\beta -1}$ on square \#63)}{figure.26}{}}
